  "title": "General Awareness: Psu Gk",
  "order": 4,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "gc1d1tm",
      "content": "<strong>UNIT 4 — GENERAL AWARENESS: PSU GK</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "nzkss5t",
      "content": "This unit covers General Awareness specific to Public Sector Undertakings in India. Questions on PSU classification, Navratna/Maharatna/Miniratna status, important PSU facts, government schemes affecting PSUs, and Indian economy fundamentals are commonly asked in all PSU CBT exams."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "ztrpbg9",
      "content": "<strong>4.1  PSU Classification System</strong>"
    },
    {
      "id": "mr822ol",
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
        {
          "isHeader": true,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Category</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Criteria (Key)</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Number (approx.)</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Examples</strong></p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Maharatna</p>",
            "<p>Net profit &gt; Rs. 5,000 cr avg 3 yrs; Net worth &gt; Rs. 15,000 cr; Turnover &gt; Rs. 25,000 cr</p>",
            "<p>14</p>",
            "<p>ONGC, BHEL, NTPC, CIL, SAIL, HAL</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Navratna</p>",
            "<p>Net profit &gt; Rs. 2,000 cr OR Turnover &gt; Rs. 8,000 cr; 60+ composite score</p>",
            "<p>27</p>",
            "<p>BEL, NALCO, NHPC, NLC, RINL, NMDC</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Miniratna-I</p>",
            "<p>Net profit in last 3 years; Turnover &gt; Rs. 3,000 cr OR net profit &gt; Rs. 30 cr</p>",
            "<p>65+</p>",
            "<p>BEML, AAI, Antrix Corporation</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Miniratna-II</p>",
            "<p>Continuously profit making for 3 yrs; net worth &gt; Rs. 150 cr</p>",
            "<p>15+</p>",
            "<p>MTNL, Balmer Lawrie</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n47o2dc",
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
        {
          "isHeader": true,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Key Fact: </strong>HAL was elevated to Maharatna status on 12 October 2024 — the 14th Maharatna CPSE in India.</p><p><strong>Key Fact: </strong>NRL (Numaligarh Refinery Ltd.) became the 27th Navratna CPSE on 1 December 2025.</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
